silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_03_olog_node_arrow_law_concrete_anchor_node_a silm:hasExample "In 'NodeA_VetRecord', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, Node A in the olog node-arrow diagram is VetRecord_Mittens — the physical veterinary record for Mittens. It is the domain of the lambda_evidence arrow and the storedAs arrow. It is a source, not the apex.." .
